Apple's HomeView finally launched last Friday, and we're getting to learn all the little details about the new hub. We've <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/13/homeview-tidbits-2/">rounded up a list of tidbits</a> for those setting up a HomeView or thinking about getting one.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/homeview-lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1070346" /><br/>
