<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/11/iphone-20-pro-screen-protectors.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1077875" /><br/>
Another rumor says the device will <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/18/iphone-20-pro-rumored-to-return-to-titanium/">return to a titanium frame</a> from the current aluminum, but the real highlight is said to be a nearly borderless display with <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/17/iphone-20-pro-screen-protectors-rumored-design/">glass that curves down over all four edges</a> as seen in recent screen protector designs based on alleged leaks.<br/>
